00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.662
(laughing)

00:04:06.662 --> 00:04:07.495
- When they'd always be like,

00:04:07.495 --> 00:04:08.475
you all want to study together?

00:04:08.475 --> 00:04:09.353
I'm like, no.

00:04:09.353 --> 00:04:10.461
- Oh no, I was always like yes.

00:04:10.461 --> 00:04:11.294
Because--

00:04:11.294 --> 00:04:12.685
- Now I'm exactly the
same as Connor actually.

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:16.274
- Because I know that if I go
home and I'm in my own room

00:04:16.274 --> 00:04:17.690
