00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.085
'Cause no one's judging me
for just being like, well,

00:04:20.085 --> 00:04:22.036
I could just play some games?

00:04:22.036 --> 00:04:22.869
- But when I'm around my friends,

00:04:22.869 --> 00:04:24.414
I want to talk to my friends?

00:04:24.414 --> 00:04:25.747
- No, same here.

00:04:26.582 --> 00:04:28.248
When there was always
a group study session,

00:04:28.248 --> 00:04:29.704
we'd have, in university,

00:04:29.704 --> 00:04:30.633
I remember we'd always have,

00:04:30.633 --> 00:04:33.093
the first hour was nice and productive.

00:04:33.093 --> 00:04:34.858
We'd start going over problems,

00:04:34.858 --> 00:04:36.808
and then people would get bored,

00:04:36.808 --> 00:04:37.654
and then we'd just talk about--

00:04:37.654 --> 00:04:38.821
- You want to watch this YouTube video?

00:04:38.821 --> 00:04:39.847
- Yeah, exactly!

00:04:39.847 --> 00:04:41.245
(laughing)

00:04:41.245 --> 00:04:42.345
- That's always what would happen.

00:04:42.345 --> 00:04:43.998
- No, I was a model asian son,

00:04:43.998 --> 00:04:46.778
so I genuinely just like, hey,

00:04:46.778 --> 00:04:47.756
do you want to go to the library

00:04:47.756 --> 00:04:48.896
and do some study this session?

00:04:48.896 --> 00:04:49.729
- I don't believe you.

00:04:49.729 --> 00:04:52.028
- And then we'd put our
headphones in and just study,

00:04:52.028 --> 00:04:53.609
because if there's people around me--

00:04:53.609 --> 00:04:54.494
- That's a fucking lie.

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:55.327
- No, no.

00:04:55.327 --> 00:04:56.160
Legit.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.143
- There's no way.

00:04:57.143 --> 00:04:59.280
And we all met up, and we all studied.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.113
- [Joey] Yeah!

00:05:00.113 --> 00:05:00.946
- It's like?

00:05:00.946 --> 00:05:02.419
- Why do you think I'm so galaxy brained.

00:05:02.419 --> 00:05:03.252
(laughing)

00:05:03.252 --> 00:05:04.812
- I'll tell you the real MVP,

00:05:04.812 --> 00:05:06.140
which wasn't my lecturer,

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:08.015
but my actual real lecturer was,

00:05:08.015 --> 00:05:10.707
shout out to those Indian YouTube lectures

00:05:10.707 --> 00:05:12.127
