00:05:12.127 --> 00:05:13.355
- Khan Academy re uploads?

00:05:13.355 --> 00:05:14.188
- [Garnt] Yeah!

00:05:14.188 --> 00:05:15.021
- Wait, what's that?

00:05:15.021 --> 00:05:17.559
- Like if you did maths
or anything engineering,

00:05:17.559 --> 00:05:20.226
there was always this channel.

00:05:20.226 --> 00:05:21.841
I can't remember, it might
have been Khan Academy.

00:05:21.841 --> 00:05:22.674
It was something like that,

00:05:22.674 --> 00:05:24.745
where they would just upload the lectures

00:05:24.745 --> 00:05:26.523
that are shorter and way more informative.

00:05:26.523 --> 00:05:27.851
- Yeah, huh.

00:05:27.851 --> 00:05:29.308
Kind of like Cliffnotes?

00:05:29.308 --> 00:05:30.311
