you'd sit there for an hour,

00:05:36.105 --> 00:05:37.577
you wouldn't take any of this in,

00:05:37.577 --> 00:05:38.871
and then when you're revising,

00:05:38.871 --> 00:05:40.234
you search up, hey,

00:05:40.234 --> 00:05:41.605
X topic, like,

00:05:41.605 --> 00:05:44.189
how do I use, how do I do
second order integrate,

00:05:44.189 --> 00:05:46.473
inte, I can't even fucking say--

00:05:46.473 --> 00:05:48.707
- Integers.
- Integers.

00:05:48.707 --> 00:05:51.204
And there'd just be always this,

00:05:51.204 --> 00:05:53.409
it was always in Indian
guy doing the lectures.

00:05:53.409 --> 00:05:55.045
I don't know why.

00:05:55.045 --> 00:05:56.030
- They just know maths, man.

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:57.382
They get it, they get it.

00:05:57.382 --> 00:05:58.529
They get it, man.

00:05:58.529 --> 00:06:00.590
