00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.915
I just went to the traditional route.

00:06:02.915 --> 00:06:04.764
- If you did anything
maths or engineering,

00:06:04.764 --> 00:06:07.154
at some point an Indian man on
the internet would save you.

00:06:07.154 --> 00:06:08.599
Like, that's just how it is.

00:06:08.599 --> 00:06:09.880
Like that's just,

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:10.804
'cause I don't know why--

00:06:10.804 --> 00:06:12.888
- Is that maybe like only a UK thing?

00:06:12.888 --> 00:06:13.721
- No, no,

00:06:13.721 --> 00:06:14.554
no.

00:06:14.554 --> 00:06:16.581
'Cause it was like Americans
too would use these things.

00:06:16.581 --> 00:06:18.048
- I think it's an engineering thing.

00:06:18.048 --> 00:06:19.309
Must be an engineering thing.

00:06:19.309 --> 00:06:20.454
- Yeah, I never did engineering.

00:06:20.454 --> 00:06:21.473
- Or the sciences.

00:06:21.473 --> 00:06:22.398
- Maybe.

00:06:22.398 --> 00:06:23.878
- Yeah, I never had anything like that.

00:06:23.878 --> 00:06:25.856
I mean, I had Indian lecturers

00:06:25.856 --> 00:06:27.915
