00:06:46.579 --> 00:06:47.573
(laughing)

00:06:47.573 --> 00:06:50.004
'Cause like, Welsh internet
isn't really a thing.

00:06:50.004 --> 00:06:52.610
So anytime I'd want to
cheat, I just couldn't.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:53.927
'Cause I couldn't google any of this shit.

00:06:53.927 --> 00:06:55.632
So I didn't know what I was looking up.

00:06:55.632 --> 00:06:56.465
- [Joey] Yeah, yeah,

00:06:56.465 --> 00:06:57.298
- But yeah, no.

00:06:57.298 --> 00:06:59.874
Oh my God, my lifestyle in
university was so unhealthy.

00:06:59.874 --> 00:07:01.074
