00:07:20.987 --> 00:07:23.531
would have always the
peak optimal lifestyle,

00:07:23.531 --> 00:07:26.469
and then there was everyone else who was,

00:07:26.469 --> 00:07:27.715
like, did--

00:07:27.715 --> 00:07:29.139
