wearing a polo shirt.

00:07:41.755 --> 00:07:43.359
He can afford a polo shirt?

00:07:43.359 --> 00:07:45.838
Get out of here, fuck off.

00:07:45.838 --> 00:07:49.602
- I feel like because I went
straight into YouTube from uni.

00:07:49.602 --> 00:07:51.385
- Yeah, you got the uni lifestyle.

00:07:51.385 --> 00:07:54.061
- I kind of just didn't change anything,

00:07:54.061 --> 00:07:55.929
except for, like,

00:07:55.929 --> 00:07:59.462
I even had an approach
to YouTube making in uni.

00:07:59.462 --> 00:08:02.307
Like I was procrastinating my videos

00:08:02.307 --> 00:08:04.817
the way I was doing with my lectures,

00:08:04.817 --> 00:08:06.503
where I would not do anything,

