in our apartments, right?

00:54:19.084 --> 00:54:19.976
- Me, me.

00:54:19.976 --> 00:54:21.817
- Fucking monkeying around.

00:54:21.817 --> 00:54:23.139
- Tik Tok dance.

00:54:23.139 --> 00:54:25.156
(laughing)

00:54:25.156 --> 00:54:26.513
- Yeah, so I sent that.

00:54:26.513 --> 00:54:29.460
I went down, I put it in her letterbox.

00:54:29.460 --> 00:54:30.507
Surprise, surprise,

00:54:30.507 --> 00:54:31.854
