moment she read that letter,

00:54:35.290 --> 00:54:36.625
she was like, oh shit.

00:54:36.625 --> 00:54:38.300
He ain't a gaijin.

00:54:38.300 --> 00:54:40.019
He's a nihonji.

00:54:40.019 --> 00:54:42.428
- You just slam dunked a
senile with some Japanese.

00:54:42.428 --> 00:54:45.157
- I was just like, I fucking got that.

00:54:45.157 --> 00:54:47.200
I had to do it to her.

00:54:47.200 --> 00:54:50.315
- When I introduced myself
to the neighbors as well,

00:54:50.315 --> 00:54:51.148
the one to the,

00:54:51.148 --> 00:54:52.642
