the end that is just nothing.

00:54:56.560 --> 00:54:57.393
- [Joey] Like window?

00:54:57.393 --> 00:54:58.643
- Yeah, so it's great.

00:54:58.643 --> 00:55:01.318
I can be loud during the day and whatever.

00:55:01.318 --> 00:55:04.277
So the neighbors to the
right of me weren't in,

00:55:04.277 --> 00:55:07.040
