00:55:13.352 --> 00:55:14.185
'Cause you went with him, didn't you?

00:55:14.185 --> 00:55:15.018
- No, you weren't there.

00:55:15.018 --> 00:55:15.851
You weren't there, okay.

00:55:15.851 --> 00:55:19.080
