00:56:43.519 --> 00:56:45.369
The translators like,
she's feeling unwell.

00:56:45.369 --> 00:56:48.219
(laughing)

00:56:48.219 --> 00:56:50.610
- It was probably something like that.

00:56:50.610 --> 00:56:51.759
- Yeah, it was probably
something like that.

00:56:51.759 --> 00:56:52.592
- But, I mean,

00:56:52.592 --> 00:56:54.217
I bump into my other
neighbors all the time,

00:56:54.217 --> 00:56:55.050
