00:57:04.006 --> 00:57:04.839
- And that's good,

00:57:04.839 --> 00:57:07.632
because Aki isn't the most
proficient in Japanese, right?

00:57:07.632 --> 00:57:09.318
But they obviously know that,

00:57:09.318 --> 00:57:10.698
and so every time they meet on the stairs.

00:57:10.698 --> 00:57:11.611
It was really weird because, like,

00:57:11.611 --> 00:57:12.989
I was walking to my local supermarket

00:57:12.989 --> 00:57:15.828
