00:57:33.782 --> 00:57:37.050
And I'm like, I thought
you said you lived in LA?

00:57:37.050 --> 00:57:39.506
That doesn't sound very Los Angeles like?

00:57:39.506 --> 00:57:40.741
And yeah, I was just like,

00:57:40.741 --> 00:57:42.385
oh, oh hi.

00:57:42.385 --> 00:57:43.218
I guess?

00:57:43.218 --> 00:57:45.518
'Cause I was fully expecting
to do the whole bow thing,

00:57:45.518 --> 00:57:46.351
