really fucking nice here,

00:57:50.520 --> 00:57:51.505
and they love speaking to you.

00:57:51.505 --> 00:57:52.338
- [Joey] Yeah.

00:57:52.338 --> 00:57:53.171
- And then other times, like,

00:57:53.171 --> 00:57:55.024
they just want you dead.

00:57:55.024 --> 00:57:55.857
- [Joey] Yeah!

00:57:55.857 --> 00:57:57.746
- I guess that's just old people
everywhere with foreigners,

00:57:57.746 --> 00:57:58.579
right, though?

00:57:58.579 --> 00:57:59.412
So that's not only Japanese--

00:57:59.412 --> 00:58:01.822
