00:58:07.593 --> 00:58:08.426
so I don't know--

00:58:08.426 --> 00:58:09.626
- I mean, in England,

00:58:09.626 --> 00:58:13.118
nobody talks to each other
or acknowledges each other.

00:58:13.118 --> 00:58:14.573
